      "description": "The actual source action copies the repository URL; this preview shows its expanding label and focus treatment.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-source\" aria-label=\"复制 IAVSE 项目来源\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-source-short\">获取源码</span><span class=\"ds-source-long\">github.com/IntMainJhy/IAVSE</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-source{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:44px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);color:var(--iavse-background,#fff);font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:filter 180ms,transform 180ms}.ds-source svg{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none}.ds-source-long{display:none;white-space:nowrap}.ds-source:is(:hover,:focus-visible) .ds-source-short{display:none}.ds-source:is(:hover,:focus-visible) .ds-source-long{display:inline}.ds-source:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}.ds-source:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-source:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Explore resources",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Bordered public action for the resource directory.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-explore\" href=\"/resources\">探索资源<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-explore{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 20px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:12px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 180ms}.ds-explore svg{width:16px;height:16px;transition:transform 300ms}.ds-explore:hover{background:var(--iavse-muted,#eef3f7)}.ds-explore:hover svg{transform:translateX(2px)}.ds-explore:active{background:var(--iavse-sky,#e5f2fb)}.ds-explore:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Three-link capsule",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Public navigation retains the three-link capsule and separate theme control.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">首页</a><a href=\"/resources\">资源</a><a href=\"/about\">关于</a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"切换外观\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.9 13A9 9 0 0 1 11 3.1 9 9 0 1 0 20.9 13Z\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);box-shadow:0 1px 2px #0000000d;font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);white-space:nowrap}.ds-nav a{padding:6px 16px;border-radius:9999px;color:var(--iavse-secondary,#4d6171);text-decoration:none;transition:color 300ms,background-color 300ms}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a) 5%,var(--iavse-background,#fff));box-shadow:0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb,var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a) 8%,transparent)}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a)}.ds-nav button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);cursor:pointer}.ds-nav button svg{width:16px;height:16px}.ds-nav button:hover,.ds-nav a:active{background:var(--iavse-muted,#eef3f7)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feature chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "feature-chip",
      "description": "Compact capability labels in the retained About layout.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-feature\">可视化画布</span>",
      "css": ".ds-feature{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);box-shadow:0 1px 2px #0000000d}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Contact panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "contact-panel",
      "description": "Sky outer frame, readable introduction and a separate surface for contact destinations.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-contact\"><div class=\"ds-contact-copy\"><h2>Let’s connect</h2><p>发现值得留下的内容，也分享自己的实践。从一份资源、一篇文章或一个个人空间开始。</p></div><div class=\"ds-contact-details\"><a href=\"/community\">前往社区</a><a href=\"/workspace/account\">管理账号</a></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-contact{display:grid;gap:24px;padding:30px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:28px;background:var(--iavse-sky,#e5f2fb);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);font-family:var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-contact-copy h2{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,44px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-contact-copy p{max-width:38ch;margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--iavse-secondary,#4d6171);text-wrap:balance}.ds-contact-details{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:20px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff)}.ds-contact-details a{color:var(--iavse-secondary,#4d6171);font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}.ds-contact-details a:hover{color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);text-decoration:underline}.ds-contact-details a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Application field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "application-input",
      "description": "Shared field surface and native focus behavior; validation remains owned by the form.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-resource-search\">搜索资源</label><input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-resource-search\" name=\"resource-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"输入名称或关键词\">",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--iavse-secondary,#4d6171);font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-field{display:block;width:min(calc(100% - 30px),320px);min-height:44px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:12px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);font:400 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;caret-color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);transition:border-color 180ms}.ds-field::placeholder{color:var(--iavse-subtle,#607180);opacity:1}.ds-field:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a) 30%,var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed))}.ds-field:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Application primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "application-button",
      "description": "Foreground-filled action within existing operating flows.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-app-button\" type=\"button\">保存草稿</button>",
      "css": ".ds-app-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:42px;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:12px;background:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);color:var(--iavse-background,#fff);font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;cursor:pointer;transition:filter 180ms,transform 180ms}.ds-app-button:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}.ds-app-button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-app-button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-app-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected filter pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-pill",
      "description": "Selected catalog filters invert the shared foreground and surface; category tabs use their separate sky state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-filter-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"资源筛选\"><button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">已收藏</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-filter-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-filter{padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:9999px;background:var(--iavse-muted,#eef3f7);color:var(--iavse-secondary,#4d6171);font:500 14px/20px var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:color 180ms,background-color 180ms,border-color 180ms}.ds-filter:hover{border-color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a)}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);color:var(--iavse-background,#fff)}.ds-filter:active{filter:brightness(.95)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Operating card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "application-card",
      "description": "Shared functional panel with card corners, a fine border and restrained resting shadow.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-app-card\"><h3>收藏的资源</h3><p>在这里继续查找你从目录中收藏的资料。</p><a href=\"/workspace/bookmarks\">查看收藏</a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-app-card{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:20px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);box-shadow:var(--iavse-shadow,0 3px 12px -9px #173c5f36);font:400 15px/1.6 var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-app-card h3{margin:0 0 12px;font:500 20px/1.2 var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-app-card p{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--iavse-secondary,#4d6171)}.ds-app-card a{color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);font-size:14px;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-app-card a:hover{color:var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4)}.ds-app-card a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Language trigger",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "language-trigger",
      "description": "Bordered language control used within the existing application shell.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-language\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20M12 2a17 17 0 0 1 0 20 17 17 0 0 1 0-20\"/></svg><span>简体中文</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-language{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--iavse-border,#dce5ed);border-radius:12px;background:var(--iavse-background,#fff);color:var(--iavse-foreground,#172b3a);font:500 13px/1.4 var(--iavse-font,\"IAVSE Sans\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms}.ds-language svg{width:14px;height:14px}.ds-language:hover{background:var(--iavse-muted,#eef3f7)}.ds-language:active{background:var(--iavse-sky,#e5f2fb)}.ds-language:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--iavse-focus,#1266a4);outline-offset:4px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Clarity for creative work",
    "overview": "IAVSE pairs a cool, quiet canvas with white surfaces, readable blue-gray type and pale sky, sage and warm grouping colors. Clear spacing and restrained hierarchy let resources, community activity and publishing tasks remain the focus. A self-hosted Geist face, soft card edges and a light CSS atmosphere give the existing application a coherent IAVSE character.\n\nThe public composition and interaction baseline comes from [RBP Portfolio](https://github.com/DavidHDev/rbp-portfolio), pinned at `1581b9b8e5876f60e5eb844970747506980c4412`. The current design independently refines its typography, spacing, colors, frames and backdrop. General principles of spacing, type hierarchy, pale surfaces and grouping informed this refinement; the cancelled Cloudlight template migration remains cancelled. No Cloudlight code, shader or assets are included.\n\nThis file is the single current platform visual specification. [IAVSE tokens and controls](src/app/iavse-system.css), the [scoped template input](src/styles/rbp-template.input.css) and the [host bridge](src/app/rbp-bridge.css) implement it. [Implementation notes](docs/portfolio-frontend.md) distinguish retained components from independent changes. Community, catalogs, accounts, administration and the editor shell share these primitives within their functional layouts. User-authored canvases, published blog themes, uploaded images and third-party previews retain their own appearance and rights.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool light and dark canvases with clear text roles and restrained tinted groups.",
      "Self-hosted Geist under the CSS alias IAVSE Sans, with system and CJK fallbacks.",
      "Existing split Hero, four Projects, Contact and capsule navigation as the public baseline.",
      "Independently refined type, spacing, card surfaces and CSS atmosphere.",
      "First-viewport upward fades, bounded staggering and accessible motion fallbacks.",
      "Functional application layouts, truthful content and preserved third-party attribution."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Role Continuity Rule",
        "body": "Use the same semantic role across public and operating pages; an older feature alias must resolve to the IAVSE palette.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Source Identity Rule",
        "body": "Keep source screenshots, member content and authored themes recognizable and attributed. Examples must remain labeled.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Hierarchy Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the distinction between public introduction copy, application body copy and compact labels. Verify Chinese, English and Japanese wrapping at the actual available width.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Existing Workflow Rule",
        "body": "Refine hierarchy and surfaces within the existing public composition and functional layouts. Keep search, publishing, account, moderation and editor controls in their working flows.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the shared IAVSE semantic tokens and font role across platform UI.",
      "Do preserve the existing public composition and working application flows while applying the documented refinements.",
      "Do use pale tints to group content and preserve source images inside previews.",
      "Do verify heading and introduction wrapping in Chinese, English and Japanese on desktop and mobile.",
      "Do trigger viewport entry once, cap group delays at 210ms and reveal keyboard-focused content immediately.",
      "Do retain labeled examples, actual empty states, attribution and accessible motion fallbacks."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't import Cloudlight code, shaders or assets, or revive the cancelled direct template migration.",
      "Don't claim the refined type, spacing and surfaces are an exact reproduction of RBP's original geometry.",
      "Don't apply the platform skin or entry animation inside authored canvas documents or third-party previews.",
      "Don't stop the visible portrait's normal frame loop after its hover blend settles.",
      "Don't invent users, posts, endorsements or engagement totals to fill a layout.",
      "Don't present the RBP template as MIT-licensed, claim authorship of Geist or expand third-party permissions."
    ]
  }
}
